 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” HVAC company, and the right choice depends on your neighborhood and whether you need emergency service. **For a starting point, I’d call George Brazil**: its BBB profile lists 24-hour service and an A+ rating. **Hays Cooling Heating and Plumbing** is another established local option.\n\nBefore booking, ask for the diagnostic fee, an itemized estimate, and whether the fee is credited toward the repair. Check the contractor’s Arizona ROC license, and get a second opinion before approving an expensive replacement. BBB ratings are only one signal—not a guarantee of a good experience.\n\nIf you share your Phoenix ZIP code and whether the AC is completely out, I can help narrow the options.",
